1:["$","$La",null,{"current":"path","children":["$","main",null,{"className":"rux-workspace","aria-label":"Learning Path","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"rux-workspace__body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"ln-container","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"page-head","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Recommended Order"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Learning Path"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The order follows data dependencies — what must exist before what — rather than menus or modules. Each stage says why it comes where it does; read a guide first, then run it against a training environment. Statuses are shown openly: Draft means exactly that."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"catalog","children":[["$","article","create-basic-test-items-and-defaults",{"className":"catalog-card rux-card rux-card--solid","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"chips","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"rux-badge rux-badge--accent","children":["Stage ",1]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"rux-badge","children":"Build the master data"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"rux-badge","children":"Draft"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"rux-badge","children":["v","3.6"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"rux-badge","children":[203," Steps"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Create Basic Test Items and Defaults"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Start here: every other procedure consumes master data. This guide builds a small, self-contained training family — items, defaults, bill of material, routing, costing, and component stock — and its final phase hands a qualified case to the production guide."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"endpoint","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Completion Boundary"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Three base test items with verified Purchase and Job Shop defaults, an approved bill of material and routing, confirmed costing, and component stock — a training case read